<article class="env-definition" id="0C72">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0C72">Definition <span data-tag="0C72">55.3.4</span>.</a> We say $n, m_ i, a_{ij}, w_ i, g_ i$ is a <em>numerical type of genus $g$</em> if $g = 1 + \sum m_ i(w_ i(g_ i - 1) - \frac{1}{2} a_{ii})$ is the integer from Lemma <a href="/tag/0C71" data-tag="0C71">55.3.3</a>. </p>
</article>